## Commands
```bash
node server/index.mjs          # Start dev server (port 8787)
npm run build                  # Vite production build
npx playwright test            # E2E tests
node server/seed-youth-gehc.cjs  # Seed DB (CJS, works)
node server/_dbstate.cjs       # Check DB state
```
